OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over major Bank Holiday
OL,4,Arail disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FRail passengers travelling over the
OL,7,FAugust Bank Holiday weekend are being
OL,8,Fwarned to expect significant disruption
OL,9,Fdue to strike action and major
OL,10,Fengineering works.
OL,12,FEast Midlands Railway (EMR) has advised
OL,13,Fcustomers to make only "essential"
OL,14,Fjourneys on Sunday and Monday after
OL,15,Fmembers of the Rail, Maritime and
OL,16,FTransport (RMT) union announced further
OL,17,Findustrial action in an ongoing dispute
OL,18,Fover the operator's new Aurora Class
OL,19,F810 fleet.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
