OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over major Bank Holiday
OL,4,Arail disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are also planned engineering
OL,7,Fworks on CrossCountry service routes
OL,8,Fnear Birmingham and other works on the
OL,9,FEast Coast Main Line, with no services
OL,10,Fbetween Peterborough and London.
OL,12,FPassengers are being advised to check
OL,13,Ftheir journeys before setting off.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
